    new "顾问们此刻笑了起来，紧张的气氛似乎已经消散。"

    old "Jaeid only bowed."
    new "贾伊德只是躬身行礼。"

    old "Thank you, Great Khan, for respecting my refusal."
    new "多谢大汗尊重我的拒绝。"

    old "The Khan waved his great hands."
    new "可汗挥了挥他那双大手。"

    old "It is fine, think no more of it. Let the matter rest. Please, continue to partake."
    new "没事，别再想了。此事就此作罢。请继续吧。"

    old "Place the crown on your own head"
    new "将王冠戴在自己头上"

    old "Suddenly, Sarah's hands steadied. The tremblings of her fingers faded."
    new "突然，莎拉的手稳住了。她手指的颤抖渐渐平息。"

    old "She was the daughter of a long line."
    new "她是源远流长的家族之女。"

    old "She was no slave."
    new "她绝非奴隶。"

    old "She would play no part in this farce."
    new "她绝不会在这场闹剧中扮演任何角色。"

    old "Sarah turned to face the crowd."
    new "莎拉转过身，面向人群。"

    old "Deathly silence."
    new "死一般的寂静。"

    old "She raised up the crown and placed it atop her own head."
    new "她举起王冠，戴在了自己的头上。"

    old "A shock ran through the crowd."
    new "人群中一阵骚动。"

    old "Then screaming. Insults. Rage."
    new "然后是尖叫。辱骂。愤怒。"

    old "Sarah never saw the blade that ended her life; the world only went dark."
    new "莎拉甚至没看见夺走她性命的那把刀；世界便陷入了黑暗。"

